OL,3,APope praises young people's 'energy and
OL,4,Acommitment' at huge open-air Mass in
OL,5,AParis
OL,6,
OL,7,FPope Leo XIV has praised the
OL,8,F"enthusiasm, energy and commitment"
OL,9,Fyoung people bring to the Catholic
OL,10,FChurch as dense crowds attended an
OL,11,Fopen-air Mass in Paris.
OL,13,FAn estimated 700,000 people had
OL,14,Fgathered for the Mass celebrated by the
OL,15,FPope from a special altar on the Place
OL,16,Fde la Concorde, on the second day of
OL,17,Fhis four-day visit to France.
OL,19,FIt began after the pontiff rode down
OL,20,Fthe Champs-Elysees Avenue waving to
OL,21,Fcrowds from his open-topped popemobile.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
