OL,3,APope praises young people's 'energy and
OL,4,Acommitment' at huge open-air Mass in
OL,5,AParis
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany senior politicians attended the
OL,8,FMass. On Friday, the Pope met French
OL,9,FPresident Emmanuel Macron.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
