OL,3,ANor'easter brings flooding as New York
OL,4,Aand New Jersey declare emergency
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of millions of people across the
OL,7,Fnorth-eastern US are in the path of a
OL,8,Fpowerful storm bringing coastal
OL,9,Fflooding, power cuts, travel chaos and
OL,10,Fcancelled stadium events.
OL,12,FThe so-called nor'easter is bringing
OL,13,F"dangerous coastal flooding and beach
OL,14,Fconditions, strong winds and heavy
OL,15,Frainfall" to areas including New York
OL,16,FCity and Boston on Saturday, the US
OL,17,FNational Weather Service (NWS) said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
